The following set of examples have been tested with GCC 4.1.1 and
binutils 2.16.91.7 compiled as coded in

svn+ssh://repo-arco.mine.nu/var/svn/mparm/prj/mparm/toolchain/

hello:
	This is the basic Hello World example.

hello++:
	C++ version of the Hello World example. It uses constructors
	and destructors but it doesn't use 

basics:
	Some very basic C++ tests for global constructors, normal
	constructors, operator new and delete

except:
	Basic C++ exception propagation.

alloc:
	Allocation tests. Uses malloc/free for all the available memory.

pthread:
	Pthreads test.

icee:
	Small IceE application.

